  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migration Management Framework (MMF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program strengthens governments&apos; capacities to support evidence-based migration management by leveraging the work done through IOM&apos;s Migration Governance Indicators (MGI). The MGI helps governments, upon request, take stock of their migration policies and strategies to identify good practices and areas with potential for further development. By focusing on government ownership of the process, the MGI supports governments to gradually improve their migration management systems. The two-year program structure will contain three main components: conducting MGI assessments at national and local levels; informing Global Compact on Migration engagement by developing data bulletins; and influencing policy change through building the capacity of IOM missions.</narrative>
  </description>
